OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss 'right' to drop
OL,4,Aprivate security plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shelving of plans to deploy private
OL,7,Fsecurity guards to patrol towns in
OL,8,FLeicestershire has been welcomed by
OL,9,Fopponents of the move.
OL,11,FIn May, Reform UK police and crime
OL,12,Fcommissioner (PCC) Rupert Matthews said
OL,13,Fhe was looking at spending #2m on 20 to
OL,14,F30 marshals, to provide a "visible and
OL,15,Funiformed" presence to "improve
OL,16,Fcommunity safety".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
