OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss 'right' to drop
OL,4,Aprivate security plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, on Monday he announced instead
OL,7,Fan agreement to provide more resources
OL,8,Fto Leicestershire Police to carry out
OL,9,Fthe patrols, which are set to start
OL,10,Fbefore Christmas and continue to May
OL,11,F2028.
OL,13,FMembers of the Leicestershire and
OL,14,FRutland Police and Crime Panel are due
OL,15,Fto discuss the #1.6m plan later this
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
